#lang rmn/v2
(map
  ("type" "RecursiveFourCircuitFabricRequirementsBaseline")
  ("version" 8)
  ("precondition" "The Leader has mandated a territory-wide cutover from flat and competing operational representations to one recursive FOUR/RMN circuit method, with mathematical law on the left hand and public-standard conformance on the right hand.")
  ("operation" "Fabricate the accessible Union as recursively composable sovereign dies and circuits; replace prohibited carriers and execution paths in place; verify every synthesis, border, consensus, custody, safety, and observation property before admitting the resulting cut.")
  ("postcondition" "Every live operation in admitted territory is expressed by the canonical RMN circuit carrier, uses the proper standard boundary provider, preserves sovereign interiors, settles only nonfactorable obligations through standard smart accounts, and is recursively observable through typed pinouts and residues without a central interior view.")
  ("refusal" "Refuse compatibility shims, dual writes, legacy fallbacks, flat scale labels, second ontologies, central Union services, ambient cross-membrane imports, mock conformance, EOA execution, custom public protocols, authoritative JSON or JSONL, ordinal FOUR, untyped residue collapse, and any cut that cannot be independently assayed.")
  ("requirements"
    ((map ("id" "FAB-R001") ("text" "The implementation MUST represent FOUR only as positiveEvidence and negativeEvidence bits and MUST represent one WIT as exactly one witnessed zero-to-one cover transition for one typed grounded predication."))
     (map ("id" "FAB-R002") ("text" "The implementation MUST give every semantic object one normalized typed RMN representation, deterministic RFC 8949 CBOR bytes, SHA-256 digest, and RFC 6920 ni URI."))
     (map ("id" "FAB-R003") ("text" "A reusable circuit definition MUST contain only its law, typed external ports, referenced child component definitions, typed nets, and declared black-box behavior. A separate sovereign assembly MUST place exactly one account, authority, custody, and territory membrane at every contextual occurrence. Definitions and instances MUST NOT embed membranes or accounts."))
     (map ("id" "FAB-R004") ("text" "Organizational scale MUST be derived contextually from recursive topology and membrane relations; operational carriers MUST NOT store enterprise, nation, colony, Union, function, task, or syscall as a flat scale enum."))
     (map ("id" "FAB-R005") ("text" "Circuit behavior MUST be monotone in the FOUR knowledge order and composite finite behavior MUST be the least fixed point of its wired child behaviors."))
     (map ("id" "FAB-R006") ("text" "The assay MUST reject a design unless Beh(Synth(D)) equals Compose_D(Beh(C_i))."))
     (map ("id" "FAB-R007") ("text" "Tensor-factorable nets MUST remain local and MUST NOT name consensus state; par nets MUST name a version-pinned EVM chain and exact RMN contract identity."))
     (map ("id" "FAB-R008") ("text" "Every persistent sovereign enterprise crossing a settlement boundary MUST use an ERC-4337 smart account with ERC-1271, EIP-712, ERC-5267, and CAIP-10 identity; no operational EOA path is permitted."))
     (map ("id" "FAB-R009") ("text" "RWIL history MUST be append-only canonical RDF named graphs over canonical RMN object identities; correction MUST add evidence and MUST NOT rewrite prior bytes."))
     (map ("id" "FAB-R010") ("text" "A2A, ActivityPub, x402, C2PA, RDF, EVM, identity, tracing, container, and device boundaries MUST use independently hireable version-pinned conforming providers where applicable."))
     (map ("id" "FAB-R011") ("text" "WIT, erasure, gas, payment assets, compute, time, custody, Chu defect, connection holonomy, price residue, and economic current-affinity MUST remain separately typed."))
     (map ("id" "FAB-R012") ("text" "A cutover wave MUST preserve superseded bytes by digest, change every dependent in the wave, delete the competing executable path, and add a scanner that rejects its return."))
     (map ("id" "FAB-R013") ("text" "The fabric MUST support recursive observation from die through nation and colony circuits and Union descent while revealing only admitted definitions, contextual membrane placements, pinouts, commitments, receipts, and residues."))
     (map ("id" "FAB-R014") ("text" "The Union MUST NOT be encoded as a largest settlement, account, chain, database, registry, ontology, runtime, CFO, ledger, or global inference fabric."))
     (map ("id" "FAB-R015") ("text" "A production cut MUST pass independent white semantic, black protocol, red pre-execution, and blue adversarial gates; no producer may attest its own work."))
     (map ("id" "FAB-R016") ("text" "MetroPlat runtime functions MUST be reassigned to the proper provider circuits and every duplicate or implicit MetroPlat runtime dependency MUST be deleted."))
     (map ("id" "FAB-R017") ("text" "Material layout MUST map reusable component definitions to mechanically assayed carriers independently of sovereign occurrence placement; one assayed carrier MAY realize multiple occurrences, every reachable definition MUST have a carrier, and every material mount MUST refine exactly one reachable component. A caller-authored function label MUST NOT count as refinement evidence."))
     (map ("id" "FAB-R018") ("text" "The EDA cut graph MUST be mechanically derived from component containment and admitted carrier evidence, MUST order dependencies before their consumers, and MUST NOT infer an enterprise boundary from directory size, package prevalence, or organization names."))
     (map ("id" "FAB-R019") ("text" "Every contractible circuit provider MUST publish one exact placement-neutral black-box leaf definition in its signed standard Agent Card. A consumer MUST compose that provider-owned interface and MUST NOT import its interior or synthesize its pinout or FOUR behavior from a role, directory, or organization label."))
     (map ("id" "FAB-R020") ("text" "A carrier refinement receipt MUST bind exact carrier material, exact component identity and behavior, a versioned executable or proof profile, complete profile vectors, and an independent provider result. Layout MUST contract a refinement provider and MUST reject labels, producer self-attestation, unobserved bytes, host-authority leakage, partial vectors, and proof-profile drift."))
     (map ("id" "FAB-R021") ("text" "A composite board MUST NOT own or import the algorithm that synthesizes its component family and occurrence assembly. It MUST contract an independently smart-accounted, signed, placement-neutral synthesis die and bind that exact synthesis receipt and seam."))
     (map ("id" "FAB-R022") ("text" "A synthesis die, composite board, layout provider, or general RMN normalizer MUST NOT attest the behavioral equivalence of work it synthesizes, conducts, places, or generically normalizes. Every admitted Beh(Synth(D)) equals Compose_D(Beh(C_i)) claim MUST be issued by the independently smart-accounted signed hierarchical-circuit-equivalence assay provider and MUST bind its exact request, provider account, circuit, assembly, behavior, components, receipt, and A2A seam."))
     (map ("id" "FAB-R023") ("text" "A general RMN normalizer, synthesis die, conductor, layout provider, or circuit participant MUST NOT assay the residue of a circuit it normalizes, produces, places, conducts, or inhabits. Every closed par-route assay MUST be issued by the independently smart-accounted signed typed-circuit-residue provider, MUST bind its exact request and provider account, MUST keep Chu seam defect, C4 connection holonomy, typed price/erasure residue, and exact economic current-affinity separate, and MUST NOT classify nonzero holonomy as fraud without an independently admitted border law."))
     (map ("id" "FAB-R024") ("text" "Every admitted WIT MUST be issued by an independently smart-accounted signed WIT-transition assay provider over exactly one immutable proposal effect cell, one immutable completion effect cell, and one evidence identity. The assay MUST bind its exact request and provider account, MUST accept exactly one zero-to-one FOUR knowledge cover with stable effect identity, and MUST append its receipt through RWIL/RDF. A general normalizer, service participant, or circuit board MUST NOT self-issue the WIT, and a consumer MUST compose the provider's signed Agent Card circuit interface.")))))
